            "message": "fix(deps): update go toolchain directive to v1.26.10 [security] (#1148)\n\nThis PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Type | Update | Change |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| [go](https://go.dev/) ([source](https://github.com/golang/go)) | toolchain | patch | `1.26.9` → `1.26.10` |\n\n---\n\n### Distrust compromised intermediate certificates in crypto/x509\n[CVE-2026-111943](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-111943) / [GO-2026-6809](https://pkg.go.dev/vuln/GO-2026-6809) / [RUSTSEC-2026-0381](https://rustsec.org/advisories/RUSTSEC-2026-0381.html) / [RUSTSEC-2026-0382](https://rustsec.org/advisories/RUSTSEC-2026-0382.html) / [RUSTSEC-2026-0383](https://rustsec.org/advisories/RUSTSEC-2026-0383.html)\n\n<details>\n<summary>More information</summary>\n\n#### Details\nOn most platforms, Go uses the given system root certificates. However, in some narrower cases, the system trust stores may not be updated without further action.\n\nTo defend against the narrower set of cases that may remain affected, a denylist was added in crypto/x509 to return an error when calling Verify with any of the known intermediate certificates that are no longer considered to be trustworthy.\n\n#### Severity\nUnknown\n\n#### References\n- [https://go.dev/cl/851047](https://go.dev/cl/851047)\n- [https://go.dev/issue/82345](https://go.dev/issue/82345)\n- [https://groups.google.com/g/golang-announce/c/66pojueaQek](https://groups.google.com/g/golang-announce/c/66pojueaQek)\n\nThis data is provided by [OSV](https://osv.dev/vulnerability/GO-2026-6809) and the [Go Vulnerability Database](https://github.com/golang/vulndb) ([CC-BY 4.0](https://github.com/golang/vulndb#license)).\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Configuration\n\n📅 **Schedule**: (UTC)\n\n- Branch creation\n  - \"\"\n- Automerge\n  - At any time (no schedule defined)\n\n🚦 **Automerge**: Disabled by config. Please merge this manually once you are satisfied.\n\n♻ **Rebasing**: Whenever PR becomes conflicted, or you tick the rebase/retry checkbox.\n\n🔕 **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update again.\n\n---\n\n - [ ] <!-- rebase-check -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check this box\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Mend Renovate](https://github.com/renovatebot/renovate).\n<!--renovate-debug:eyJjcmVhdGVkSW5WZXIiOiI0My4xOTEuMiIsInVwZGF0ZWRJblZlciI6IjQzLjE5MS4yIiwidGFyZ2V0QnJhbmNoIjoibWFpbiIsImxhYmVscyI6W119-->\n\nReviewed-on: https://gitea.com/gitea/tea/pulls/1148\nReviewed-by: silverwind <redacted@example.invalid>\nCo-authored-by: Renovate Bot <redacted@example.invalid>\n",
